    "title": "Herd Baseball Falls in Charleston to No. 15 WVU on Tuesday | Sports for River Cities Gallia, Meigs, and Mason. | wvnews.com",
    "text": "CHARLESTON, W.Va. – The Marshall University Baseball team (21-27) dropped a contest in Charleston, West Virginia, 7-2 to the No. 15 West Virginia Mountaineers (32-12) on Tuesday night at GoMart Ballpark.\nFrustrating to lose the game. What a great crowd. What a great opportunity tonight and unfortunately, we didn't play to our best ability. Just a bit too many free bases we gave them (that led to) some opportunities on the offensive side.",
